        <mxCell id="sb-9" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 12px;"&gt;&lt;i&gt;Every joint is fed by all others (virtual joints, kNN hyperedges), so deeper layers are less local. The swap test in ③ measures this per layer.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="745" y="90" width="520" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

